  "about": "A golden sacred-geometry mandala: rings, petals, spokes, hexagons and triangles in counter-rotating layers, golden-ratio spiral arms and fractal hex lace (after Radiant's Golden Throne by Paul Bakaus). The centre flares and the lines glow on the kick.",
